        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/7bcc69/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-15T15:12:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Although, I guess it's worth noting that if you deal damage multiple times, then extra applications of that damage should affect the new hit points. I'm still new to this game, but that's what I interpret, and I'm willing to be corrected.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For example, Vicious Cyclone could knock Baron Blade down to 0 after only one discard. But subsequent discards would be applied to the other side.</p>",
